<h3>Donation Request Form</h3>
<p>If you represent a nonprofit organization interested in applying for a donation from American Girl, please review the following information before continuing: </p>
<ul>
	<li>Your organization must be a registered 501 c-3 nonprofit  organization.</li>
	<li>Charitable donations are given only to fundraising auctions or raffles that benefit groups of children who are up to 12 years old (no individuals or individual families).</li>
	<li>Completed request forms must be received at American Girl at least six weeks before the fundraising event.</li>
	<li> A cover letter using your organizations letterhead must accompany the completed request form.</li>
	<li> NOTE: If your organization has received a donation from American Girl since July 2005, you are NOT eligible to apply. </li>



	</ul>	

